  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: first release. Provider-neutral file storage for OLAX services: file metadata in the service's own database, Direct (presigned URLs) and Proxy (through the API) modes, multipart uploads, public and private files, content checks, cleanup, and providers for the file system, S3-compatible stores (AWS S3, SeaweedFS, MinIO, Ceph, Cloudflare R2), Google Cloud Storage and Azure Blob Storage.",
